"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-AUTHORIAL-GRAMMAR-001__B00029_0784ef176365","block_type":"table_row","estimated_claims":1,"status_markers":[],"text":"| **Authorial Grammar** | How does that game property appear in authored prose? |
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-AUTHORIAL-GRAMMAR-001__B00031_b5445b8fd73b","block_type":"paragraph","estimated_claims":1,"status_markers":[],"text":"The Authorial Grammar governs:
